#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.ghostwriter.metainfo.xml:8
msgid "Distraction-free text editor for Markdown"
msgstr "Uređivač teksta za Markdown bez ometanja"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.ghostwriter.metainfo.xml:10
msgid "ghostwriter is a distraction-free text editor for Markdown featuring a live HTML preview as you type, theme creation, focus mode, fullscreen mode, live word count, and document navigation in an aesthetic writing environment. It comes with the cmark-gfm Markdown processor built in, and can integrate with Pandoc, MultiMarkdown, Discount, and cmark processors if they are installed."
msgstr "ghostwriter je uređivač teksta za Markdown bez ometanja koji nudi pretpregled HTML-a uživo tijekom tipkanja, izradu tema, način fokusa, prikaz preko cijelog zaslona, brojanje riječi uživo i navigaciju dokumentom u ugodnom okruženju za pisanje. Aplikacija uključuje ugrađeni procesor Markdowna cmark-gfm, a može se povezati i s procesorima Pandoc, MultiMarkdown, Discount i cmark ako su instalirani."

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.ghostwriter.metainfo.xml:20
msgid "Enjoy a distraction-free writing experience, including a full screen mode and a clean interface"
msgstr "Uživajte u pisanju bez ometanja, uz prikaz preko cijelog zaslona i jednostavno sučelje"

